  "binding_conclusion": [
    "Four-hour granularity alone does not solve the 0048 support constraint when the same calendar-equivalent training burn-in, shadow-calibration burn-in, target maturity and dependence scale are preserved.",
    "The dominant support bottleneck is the pair of long calendar-equivalent burn-ins, not the raw bar frequency. Track A begins formal support at essentially the same calendar date as 0048 despite six times more raw bars.",
